        "WORKFLOW 18 : API VLM LOADER (OLLAMA / LM STUDIO / VLLM / OPENAI) & BATCH FOLDER CAPTIONER\n1. ZiggartOpenAIVLMLoader builds a GGUF_VL_MODEL config pointing at any OpenAI-compatible HTTP endpoint (local Ollama, LM Studio, llama-server, vLLM, or OpenAI API).\n2. ZiggartBatchFolderVisionCaptioner captions an entire folder of images in one single execution pass without reloading the model between images, using Caption Presets + Verbosity + JSON checkpoint resume (.ziggart_batch_manifest.json).\n3. ZiggartDatasetCaptionCuratorAndTriggerInjector optionally strips VLM boilerplate and injects LoRA triggers across the generated sidecars."
